        "No second model.",
        "Nothing retrained."
      ],
      "say": "Hi, I'm Larkin! Most systems use one model to find evidence and another to read it. Here, the reader does both."
    },
    {
      "type": "idea",
      "text": "Read chunk keys and a query from the frozen model's own hidden states, keep the best chunks, and hand their text back to the same model.",
      "mark": "the same model",
      "say": "The idea: read keys and a query out of the frozen model's hidden states, and hand the best chunks back to the same model."
    },
